Material deliberately NOT redistributed here
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Clinical vocabularies. Concept names in OMOP's standard Condition, Measurement
and Drug domains come from SNOMED CT, LOINC and RxNorm, and are licensed
separately by their owners. This repository ships no vocabulary download and no
conversion output, so it carries none of them. Obtain a vocabulary build from
https://athena.ohdsi.org under its own terms, point OMOP_VOCAB_DIR at it, and
inspect it with tools/check_vocabulary.py.

The curated mapping registry under mappings/ records the concept a reviewer
accepted for a source string, its identifier and its name. It is a review record
of decisions made here, not a vocabulary extract, and it holds 213 entries.

Patient data. No patient-level data appears in this repository or in its history.
The CT pulmonary embolism extract is private. MIMIC-IV is available only under
PhysioNet credentialing and its data use agreement, which does not permit
redistribution; every test fixture here is fabricated.
